## markdown
# Release process

This page describes **how** we ship. _Read it_ before your first release — it’s short.

Formatting: underline, ~~strike~~, `inline code`, H2O, x2, red text and ==highlighted==.

Line one\
line two with a non-breaking space.

## Links

External: [example docs](https://example.com/docs?a=1&b=2). Page: [the other page](wcimport:page/200). Missing: [Not Exported](wcimport:missing/DOC/Not+Exported). Anchor: [jump to steps](#steps). Attachment: [the diagram](wcimport:attachment/300). Mail: [ops](mailto:ops@example.com).

## Steps

1. Freeze the branch

   - tell the team
   - wait for **green** CI
2. Tag the release

> Never release on a Friday.

---

### Unsafe input

bad link stays text;  is dropped.

## html
<h1 id="release-process">Release process</h1>
<p>This page describes <strong>how</strong> we ship. <em>Read it</em> before your first release — it’s short.</p>
<p>Formatting: <u>underline</u>, <s>strike</s>, <code>inline code</code>, H<sub>2</sub>O, x<sup>2</sup>, <span style="color:rgb(255,86,48)">red text</span> and <mark style="background-color:yellow">highlighted</mark>.</p>
<p>Line one<br>line two with a non-breaking space.</p>
<h2 id="links">Links</h2>
<p>External: <a href="https://example.com/docs?a=1&amp;b=2" rel="noopener noreferrer">example docs</a>. Page: the other page. Missing: Not Exported. Anchor: <a href="#steps" rel="noopener noreferrer">jump to steps</a>. Attachment: the diagram. Mail: <a href="mailto:ops@example.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">ops</a>.</p>
<h2 id="steps">Steps</h2>
<ol>
<li>
<p>Freeze the branch</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>tell the team</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>wait for <strong>green</strong> CI</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p>Tag the release</p>
</li>
</ol>
<blockquote>
<p>Never release on a Friday.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h3 id="unsafe-input">Unsafe input</h3>
<p>bad link stays text;  is dropped.</p>
